  << /ActualText (The final language also depends on how the date was reached\056\nIf the user already knew the date\054 the system acknowledges that it came from the user\056 If the system narrowed the field to one day\054 it describes that differently\056 And if there is not enough evidence\054 it can refuse to invent a date\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 4190 0 R
     /Pg 3670 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
